ow-then-redo.\n\n- **Elementary stubs evolved across two passes.** The original Phase 4 #4 decision (2026-05-04 PM) kept four stubs as \"real gaps\" to build later â€” `Grammar-Diagramming` (G4), `Writing-Wise-Bauer-WWE` (G4), `Grammar-Complete` (G5), and one other. **Group B later upgraded three of these to \"stub-with-spec built.\"** For example, `elementary/grade-4/Grammar-Diagramming/` got a ~1,300-word spec: spine Mary Daly *Diagramming the Sentences of the Catechism* (Reed-Kellogg tradition) with Reed & Kellogg *Graded Lessons in English* (1875, public-domain alternate); 6 units / 120 lessons / 60 hours; co-runs with `K4-WRITING-WISE-BAUER-WWE`; synthesis via visual-diff machine grading on diagram correctness.\n\n- **The three Phase 4 quarantined decisions were resolved interactively on 2026-05-04 PM**, in a walkthrough following the autonomous overnight run â€” covering the modern-language call (#3), the American History deferral (#2), and the elementary-stub dispositions (#4).\n\nNote: anchors for the Group A G8 course (`middle/grade-8/Moder...`) and the fourth elementary stub are truncated in the source, so those specifics aren't captured above."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6951,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21800,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21800},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72ea98c7-2843-4cff-aae1-5e0da8ed408d","uuid":"fcf66b7e-5683-489f-85b5-48bdefb596ef","request_id":"req_011Cc52sZ15KL6NqksgrvsBf"}
